+##### significantDigits
+
+Type: `number`\
+Default: `3`
+
+The number of significant digits to round to.
+
+Only applies when neither `minimumFractionDigits` nor `maximumFractionDigits` is set. The integer part is never rounded away, so a value shown with more integer digits than this keeps all of them.
+
+Must be an integer between 1 and 100. Any other value is ignored and the default is used, so this option never throws.
+
+```js
+import prettyBytes from 'pretty-bytes';
+
+prettyBytes(1337, {significantDigits: 2});
+//=> '1.3 kB'
+
+prettyBytes(1337, {significantDigits: 4});
+//=> '1.337 kB'
+```
+
